    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84741" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολῠ-δαίδᾰλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>highly, richly
				wrought,</i> chiefly of metal work, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θώρηξ, ἀσπίς, ὅρμος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.358
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.295
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλισμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.597
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλαμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.15
				</span></i>
			: of weaving, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἱστὸν ὑφαίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					64
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράων π. ἔρνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					2.194
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>working with great art</i> or <i>skill, very
				skilful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.743
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.80
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>).</div>
